              "cluster_id": "cancellation_scope_expansion",
              "root_cause": "The agent treated a request to cancel one item in a multi-item pending order as authorization to cancel the entire order. In task 98, it repeatedly described the proposed action as cancelling only the skateboard, then invoked an order-level cancellation that also cancelled the air purifier, hiking boots, and yoga mat and refunded the full $1,058.79. The user's confirmations approved the stated item-level action; the agent never disclosed or obtained confirmation for the broader scope. The tool executed successfully, but its effect exceeded the action presented to the user.",
